## nano's settings on the badge (the start script reads this first, then
## the syntax colours, then nanorc in the app's config folder, where your
## own settings go: "set" and "unset" lines as in nano's manual).

## No title bar: the name and state of the file show at the bottom when
## they change, which leaves one more row for text in the 25.
set minibar
## Remember what you searched for and where you were in each file.
set historylog
set positionlog
set tabsize 4
set autoindent
set zap
## Running a command needs fork(), which the badge does not have.
unbind ^T all
